      * STAND-IN FOR CICS DFHAID, FOR THE GNUCOBOL CHECK ONLY. THE
      * VALUES ARE PLACEHOLDERS (THE CHECK IS SYNTAX ONLY); NOT IBM'S
      * COPYBOOK.
       01  DFHAID.
           02  DFHENTER               PIC X VALUE ''''.
           02  DFHCLEAR               PIC X VALUE '_'.
           02  DFHPF3                 PIC X VALUE '3'.
